  "notes": "First-party Flutter portal jobs.myntra.com backed by the Spire iExchange API at io.spire2grow.com/ies/v1/p with workspace MYNTRA-93as3 (workspaceId from ?domain=jobs.myntra.com, sent as the `workspaceid` header plus `language: en`). GET /requisition/aggregation/_search returns the UI facets (jobGroup, departments - currently empty -, locations, cities, employmentType, jobType, experience, skills) over 50 requisitions; GET /requisition/_search is 1-based (page, size, selectedSortField=postedOn, selectedSortOrder=desc) and honours facet params for jobGroup and locations. There is no text-search control, so keyword is false.",
